msgstr "Hindi mai-save ang node."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The node was saved."
msgstr "Na-save ang node."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The node was deleted. Targets it reported keep their history."
msgstr "Tinanggal ang node. Pinapanatili ng mga target na iniulat nito ang kanilang kasaysayan."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "Enter a network as an address and prefix length, such as 10.20.0.0/16."
msgstr "Maglagay ng network bilang isang address at haba ng prefix, gaya ng 10.20.0.0/16."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "No device was added: the filesystem already has one, or the templates are not installed."
msgstr "Walang idinagdag na device: mayroon na nito ang filesystem, o hindi naka-install ang mga template."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device could not be mapped. It may be mapped to another filesystem."
msgstr "Hindi mai-map ang device. Maaaring naka-map ito sa isa pang filesystem."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device was mapped and the data queries and overview graphs were added."
msgstr "Nai-map ang device at idinagdag ang mga data query at overview graph."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "Cacti did not create the device. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Hindi ginawa ng Cacti ang device. Tingnan ang log ng Cacti."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device, its data queries, and its overview graphs were created."
msgstr "Ginawa ang device, mga data query nito, at mga overview graph nito."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device is no longer mapped. It and its graphs were kept; its data queries list no targets until it is mapped again."
msgstr "Hindi na naka-map ang device. Pinanatili ito at ang mga graph nito; walang ililistang target ang mga data query nito hanggang sa mai-map itong muli."

